sequenceDiagram
participant Issue as "pickingIssueService: Service"
participant Ship as "shipmentService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Issue->>+DB: Read approved allocation fragments by warehouse
Issue->>+DB: Create warehouse picking lists and shipment expectations
DB-->>-Issue: One shipment expectation per warehouse portion
Ship->>+DB: Read expected warehouses and completed picking portions
Ship->>+DB: Read payment gate and order version
alt Every expected portion ready and payment condition met
    DB-->>-Ship: Whole-order ready
else Missing portion, exception or unpaid prepaid
    DB-->>-Ship: Dispatch blocked with reason
end
Ship-->>Issue: Readiness result

